Z||000000||Haze_Performance||06-19-2000||02:54 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BAM-BAM:<BR><B>  Hey, have I told anyone that I just put a spoiler on my 85GT? <P>  It's a spoiler off of a 2000 Mustang GT. I like to eat what I kill and they say you are what you eat, so now I'm part Mustang(HE HE HE).<BR> Seriously it looks great. If I can figure out how to post a pic, I will when they are developed. I'm having them developed onto CD so it should'nt be a big deal. <P> Late, BAM OUT!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>B-B </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Hey Bam?? when will you have pictures of your car? I was going to bid on a 2000 Mustang spoiler on Ebay, but it only has 1Day:22Hours left...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  <P>||||reg||14
